      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen and Diabetes: Can You Take It, and Does It Raise Blood Sugar?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">If you are one of the 101 million Indians living with diabetes, nobody selling you a collagen supplement has told you what it does to your glucose. The short version is that the collagen is not the problem and the product might be, and the evidence runs in a direction most brands would rather not explain.</p>

