          <p>A fair number of the people who come to me about darkening at the back of the neck have never had their glucose tested, and the cream they want is not the thing they need. Diabetes is the reason a dermatology consultation sometimes turns into a request for a blood test, and the reason I ask what else a patient is taking before I add anything to it.</p>
